This project is an Android port of Replicant303 (MIT, DanimanX), built on the
low-latency architecture of ReplicantTr8s Android (MIT, DanimanX).

Third-party components:

- Oboe (https://github.com/google/oboe) — Apache License 2.0.
  See assets/licenses/Oboe-LICENSE.txt.
- AndroidX / Jetpack Compose — Apache License 2.0.
  See https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx.
- Roboto Condensed — Apache License 2.0.
  See assets/licenses/Roboto-LICENSE.txt.
- JetBrains Mono — SIL Open Font License 1.1. Used only for the promotional
  artwork, not shipped inside the APK.
- Replicant303 DSP, sequencer and preset-vault concepts — MIT, DanimanX.
- ReplicantTr8s Android audio-driver and USB MIDI architecture — MIT, DanimanX.

No Roland samples, firmware, ROM data or factory tone tables are included in
this repository. All acid lines and presets are generated by the project's own
code.

